{"speciesId":174,"names":{"fr":"Toudoudou","es":"Igglybuff","en":"Igglybuff","ja":"ププリン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It has a very soft body. If it starts to roll, it will bounce all over and be impossible to stop."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its extremely flexible and elas­ tic body makes it bounce continuous­ ly--anytime, any­ where."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Instead of walking with its short legs, it moves around by bouncing on its soft, tender body."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"IGGLYBUFF’s vocal chords are not sufficiently developed. It would hurt its throat if it were to sing too much. This POKéMON gargles with freshwater from a clean stream."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"IGGLYBUFF has a soft and plushy body that feels very much like a marshmallow. From this body wafts a gently sweet fragrance that soothes and calms the emotions of its foes."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its soft and pliable body is very bouncy. When it sings continuously with all its might, its body steadily turns a deepening pink color."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its extremely flexible and elastic body makes it bounce continuously--anytime, anywhere."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It has a very soft body. If it starts to roll, it will bounce all over and be impossible to stop."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It has a very soft body. If it starts to roll, it will bounce all over and be impossible to stop."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its extremely flexible and elastic body makes it bounce continuously--anytime, anywhere."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps est doux et élastique. Quand il commence à rebondir, on ne peut plus l’arrêter."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps est doux et élastique. Quand il commence à rebondir, on ne peut plus l’arrêter."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its body has a faintly sweet scent and is bouncy and soft. If it bounces even once, it cannot stop."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its body has a faintly sweet scent and is bouncy and soft. If it bounces even once, it cannot stop."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Plutôt que de se déplacer avec ses petites pattes, il rebondit avec son corps doux et moelleux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Para caminar, en lugar de usar los pies que tiene, opta por dar botes con su cuerpo redondo y blandito."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Instead of walking with its short legs, it moves around by bouncing on its soft, tender body."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"短い 脚で 歩くより やわらかい 体を 使って 飛び跳ねながら 動き回る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps est très doux. Quand il commence à rebondir, il est impossible de l’arrêter."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su cuerpo es muy blando. Si se pone a rodar, rebotará contra todo y será imposible de parar."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has a very soft body. If it starts to roll, it will bounce all over and be impossible to stop."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"とても やわらかい 体。 1度 転がると 弾みまくって ぜんぜん 止まれなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les cordes vocales de Toudoudou ne sont pas assez développées. S’il devait chanter trop longtemps, il se ferait mal à la gorge. Ce Pokémon se gargarise souvent avec de l’eau fraîche puisée dans un ruisseau clair."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Las cuerdas vocales de Igglybuff no están suficientemente desarrolladas. Si tuviera que cantar mucho, se haría daño en la garganta. Este Pokémon suele hacer gárgaras con agua pura de manantial."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Igglybuff’s vocal cords are not sufficiently developed. It would hurt its throat if it were to sing too much. This Pokémon gargles with freshwater from a clean stream."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"声帯が まだ 十分に 発達して いないので 歌い 続けると ノドが 痛む。 きれいな 小川の 水で うがいをするよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Toudoudou a un corps mou et pelucheux, semblable à de la guimauve. Un parfum doux et sucré s’échappe de son corps, ce qui lui permet d’apaiser et de calmer ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Igglybuff es suave y tierno, parece un merengue. Emana un aroma dulce y agradable que le sirve para calmar los ánimos de sus oponentes en combate."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Igglybuff has a soft and plushy body that feels very much like a marshmallow. From this body wafts a gently sweet fragrance that soothes and calms the emotions of its foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"マシュマロ みたいな 触り心地の 体から ほんのり 甘い においが 漂ってくるよ。 においは 敵の 気持ちを 穏やかにする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il adore chanter, mais il n’est pas encore très doué. Il s’améliore progressivement si on le complimente suffisamment."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Le apasiona cantar, pero no se le da muy bien. Cuantos más elogios reciba, más mejorarán sus dotes de cantante."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It likes to sing but is not yet good at it. With praise and encouragement, it will get better little by little."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"歌うのが 好きだが まだまだ 下手。 ちゃんと ほめてあげると 少しずつ 上手に なっていくよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il se déplace en rebondissant comme une balle. Quand il a beaucoup bougé et qu’il sue, son corps dégage une légère odeur sucrée."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se desplaza dando botes con su cuerpo. Después de hacer mucho ejercicio, empieza a sudar y desprende un ligero aroma dulce."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It moves by bouncing along. As it moves a lot, it sweats, and its body gives off a sweet aroma."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ポンポン 弾みながら 移動。 たくさん 動いて 汗を かくと ほんのり 甘い 体臭が する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il s’entraîne dur pour maîtriser le chant. Même quand il dort, il continue de faire des gammes dans ses rêves."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Practica constantemente para mejorar su canto, llegando incluso a cantar en sueños."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s always practicing its singing because it wants to improve. Even when it’s asleep, it keeps singing in its dreams!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"上手くなりたくて ずっと 歌の 練習を している。 寝ているときも 夢の 中で 歌っているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Si on le laissait faire, il passerait son temps à chanter. Il vaut donc mieux l’en empêcher pour préserver sa petite gorge."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Si le dejan, se pasa el día entero practicando su canto, así que conviene animarlo a descansar de vez en cuando para que no se destroce la voz."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Left to its own devices, it will constantly practice singing. You should make it take a break so it doesn’t hurt its throat."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"放っておくと ずーっと 歌の 練習を 続ける。 喉を 痛めないように 休ませてあげて。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il adore chanter. Son corps semblable à de la guimauve dégage une légère odeur sucrée."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Le apasiona cantar. Su cuerpo suave y esponjoso desprende un aroma ligeramente dulce."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Igglybuff loves to sing. Its marshmallow-like body gives off a faint sweet smell."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"歌を 歌うことが 大好き。 マシュマロのような 体からは ほんのり 甘い 匂いが するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se déplace en faisant rebondir son corps tout mou. Lorsque sa température corporelle augmente, il devient rose foncé."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se desplaza dando botes con su cuerpo mullido. Cuando aumenta su temperatura corporal, se va poniendo de un color rosa cada vez más intenso."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Taking advantage of the softness of its body, Igglybuff moves as if bouncing. Its body turns a deep pink when its temperature rises."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"柔らかい 体で 弾むように 動きまわる。 体温が 上がると 体は 濃い ピンク色になる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":174,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[3,"level-up",9],[4,"level-up",9],[5,"level-up",9],[6,"level-up",9],[7,"level-up",9],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",9],[11,"level-up",9],[12,"level-up",9],[13,"level-up",9],[14,"level-up",9],[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sing","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-